            "1 → **first**, 2 → **second**, 3 → **third** (úplně jiná slova)",
            "5 → **fifth**, 12 → **twelfth** (ve → f)",
            "8 → **eighth** (jen h, t už tam je)",
            "9 → **ninth** (bez e)",
            "20 → **twentieth**, 30 → **thirtieth** (y → ie)",
            "21 → twenty-**first**, 22 → twenty-**second**, 23 → twenty-**third**"
          ]
